OL,3,GNEWSABlue badge holder says city car
OL,4,Aparks 'confusing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disability access campaigner says a
OL,7,Fcity's policy on which blue badge
OL,8,Fholders can get free parking is
OL,9,F"confusing".
OL,11,FLiz Owen, a motorised wheelchair user
OL,12,Fand campaigner for improving
OL,13,Faccessibility, visited Peterborough's
OL,14,FBishops Road Car Park where the parking
OL,15,Finformation sign advised that blue
OL,16,Fbadge holders needed to pay the
OL,17,Fstandard charges "unless their vehicle
OL,18,Fis especially adapted".
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
