OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABlue badge holder says city car
OL,4,Aparks 'confusing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOwen, who lives in St Neots, has
OL,7,Fqueried how parking wardens would know
OL,8,Fif a vehicle was adapted and what the
OL,9,Fcity council's definition of "adapted"
OL,10,Fwas.
OL,12,FA council spokesperson said the local
OL,13,Fauthority was "planning a review of the
OL,14,Fcharging policy".
